{
  "Name": "MS10-018 Microsoft Internet Explorer Tabular Data Control ActiveX Memory Corruption",
  "Description": "This module exploits a memory corruption vulnerability in the Internet Explorer Tabular Data ActiveX Control. Microsoft reports that version 5.01 and 6 of Internet Explorer are vulnerable. By specifying a long value as the \"DataURL\" parameter to this control, it is possible to write a NUL byte outside the bounds of an array. By targeting control flow data on the stack, an attacker can execute arbitrary code.",
